{"id":"7a453a6b0e34f3a9","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-omega-incompleteness.md","title":"Omega Incompleteness Theorem","display":"thm-omega-incompleteness — Omega Incompleteness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-omega-incompleteness","aliases":["92-thm-omega-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-omega-incompleteness — Omega Incompleteness Theorem","depends_on":["[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-omega-complete]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-godel-sentence]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]"],"source":"第 V 章 pp. 62–63、73–74（PDF 79–80、90–91）；本地证明码版本","source_status":"原书内容的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-omega-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-omega-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-incompleteness — Omega Incompleteness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e5b54aafbcf6fc4\" href=\"?note=0e5b54aafbcf6fc4\" title=\"92-df-omega-complete\">92-df-omega-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 62–63、73–74（PDF 79–80、90–91）；本地证明码版本"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (consistency, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\)</span> (effective proof-system condition)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic strength for verifying individual proof-code computations)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}\\)</span> (omega-completeness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0e5b54aafbcf6fc4\" href=\"?note=0e5b54aafbcf6fc4\" title=\"92-df-omega-complete\">92-df-omega-complete</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}omega\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}omega\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>完备性 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0e5b54aafbcf6fc4\" href=\"?note=0e5b54aafbcf6fc4\" title=\"92-df-omega-complete\">92-df-omega-complete</a>)</li>\n<li>Gödel证明：一致系统不是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>完备的</li>\n<li>存在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span>，使每个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x)\">\\(G\\vdash\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x)\\)</span>成立，但<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\nvdash\\forall x\\,\\varphi\">\\(G\\nvdash\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>可取<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi(x)\">\\(\\psi(x)\\)</span>表达“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>不是某个固定点句的证明码”；每个标准numeral实例可验证，但其全称闭包不可证</li>\n<li>这是不完备性定理的另一种表述</li>\n<li>普通一致性只是在有效证明检查与足够算术强度仍成立时才给出此结论；任意弱或无效系统不受该式约束</li>\n</ul>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>取一个不可证 Gödel 句 γ。每个标准数码 k 都可验证不是 γ 的证明码，故 ψ(k) 可证；若 ∀kψ(k) 可证，固定点反向蕴涵又给出 γ 可证。原书在此区分 ω 相容性和 ω 不完备性，不能混用。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 pp. 62–63、73–74（PDF 79–80、90–91）；本地证明码版本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-complete","status":"resolved","id":"0e5b54aafbcf6fc4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-omega-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b823f18a7fc28400","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-elementary-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (consistency, see [[92-df-consistent]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-complete","status":"resolved","id":"0e5b54aafbcf6fc4","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}$ (omega-completeness predicate, see [[92-df-omega-complete]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-complete","status":"resolved","id":"0e5b54aafbcf6fc4","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}$ : $\\omega$完备性 (see [[92-df-omega-complete]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q","status":"resolved","id":"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"算术强度核对：$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)$ 表示每条 $Q$ 公理在 $G$ 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见[[92-lem-local-pa-proves-q]]；若继续要求 $Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)$，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 $G$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}omega\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}(G)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x)","display":false},{"tex":"G\\nvdash\\forall x\\,\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":2528,"backlinks":[{"id":"916836dbb5b34f34","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]、[[92-df-enumerability-in-system]]、[[92-lem-omega-enumeration]]与[[92-df-omega-consistency]]给出原书关于表示和 $\\omega$ 相容性的契约。本地固定 PA 的对应结果见[[92-thm-first-incompleteness]]与[[92-thm-omega-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-289","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-omega-incompleteness]]"}],"outgoing":["e0eabee5d77258a7","0e5b54aafbcf6fc4","c7befd96bd551ade","b823f18a7fc28400","360e00ddf38f0f16","468d35690d25ee42","975b3aa9a1e08797","0a1ba58f66cc8d4e"]}